# ---- acceptance-claim evidence gate (BH-527, optional — OFF is the default) ----
# Warn-first demoter for acceptance-claim verdicts (CONFIRMED / REFUTED /
# INCONCLUSIVE), default off. bin/run-build.sh reads it (same on/off arms as
# SCOPE_GATE_ENFORCE: 1|true|yes|on on, 0|''|false|no|off off, anything else off
# plus one ALERTS line); with it off the counts still reach QA_NOTE, the PR
# evidence block and the verdict row, and only the tier demotion is withheld.
# Flip to 1 after a week of `EVIDENCE confirmed=` lines in builds/*/pipeline.log;
# readout:
#   grep -ho 'EVIDENCE confirmed=[^ ]* refuted=[^ ]* inconclusive=[^ ]*' builds/*/pipeline.log | sort | uniq -c
#EVIDENCE_GATE_ENFORCE=0
